<section class="shell band">
  <h1>Get in touch</h1>
  <div class="answer">
    <p>Email is the fastest route. Therapy consults are fifteen minutes and free; supervision
    and EMDR consults are thirty minutes and free. Tell me briefly what you are looking for and
    what your week looks like, and I will send times.</p>
  </div>

